{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Excursion"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"远足代数 Excursion Algebra"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"笔记"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"GaitsgoryLinReevesExcALg","text":"Gaitsgory–Lin–Reeves"}},{"Plain":" 的阅读笔记.</p>\n<h2>AGKRRV</h2>\n<p>本文依赖于 "},{"Local":{"url":"AGKRRV1","text":"AGKRRV"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>相关笔记: "},{"Local":{"url":"notes-AGKRRV","text":"AGKRRV"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<h2>引言</h2>\n<h2>1. 带 $\\mathbb A^1$-作用的范畴</h2>\n<p>对于代数群 $H$, 有\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Mod}_{\\mathsf{DGCat}}(\\mathsf{QCoh}(H)) \\simeq \\mathsf{Comod}_{\\mathsf{DGCat}}(\\mathsf{Rep}(H)).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>远足代数的性质</h2>\n<p>本节将本文定义的远足代数与 V. Lafforgue 定义的代数作比较.</p>\n"}]}}